/*
 * Implements semantic validation of lambda bodies and construction of
 * lambda frames and delegate values.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of lambda bodies,
 *   - closure-capture validation,
 *   - return-type inference for lambdas,
 *   - construction of synthetic return statements,
 *   - validation of throwers inside lambdas,
 *   - creation of lambda frames with or without closures,
 *   - construction of NameDelegateValue and ProtoFuncPtrValue results,
 *   - error reporting for lazy and template-specialization failures.
 *
 * Lambda body validation is performed in a closure-aware context, allowing
 * correct tracking of captured variables and closure types.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::function::lambda::body
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/function/lambda/body.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-26
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
